	<markup_html><![CDATA[<section class="why-section">
    <div class="why-inner">
      <div class="why-content">
        <h2 class="section-heading">WHY CLOUDZOOM?</h2>
        <p class="section-subheading">A senior software partner for teams that want useful products and fewer release surprises.</p>
        
        <div class="benefit-list">
          <div class="benefit-item">
            <div class="benefit-icon"><i class="ph ph-check-circle"></i></div>
            <div class="benefit-text">You talk to the person actually designing and building your software &mdash; every call, every decision. No account managers translating your requirements three times.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="benefit-item">
            <div class="benefit-icon"><i class="ph ph-check-circle"></i></div>
            <div class="benefit-text">AI-assisted development speeds up discovery, implementation, refactoring, documentation, and test creation &mdash; while senior engineering judgment keeps the work grounded.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="benefit-item">
            <div class="benefit-icon"><i class="ph ph-check-circle"></i></div>
            <div class="benefit-text">We build the software your operation actually needs: customer portals, internal tools, workflow systems, integrations, dashboards, and product features that do not fit neatly inside off-the-shelf platforms.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="benefit-item">
            <div class="benefit-icon"><i class="ph ph-check-circle"></i></div>
            <div class="benefit-text">AI QA agents repeatedly walk through critical flows, click through screens, validate expected behavior, and produce clear reports so bugs are found before customers do.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="benefit-item">
            <div class="benefit-icon"><i class="ph ph-check-circle"></i></div>
            <div class="benefit-text">We scope clearly, deliver in working increments, and keep quality visible from day one. You get a technical partner &mdash; not a one-time vendor.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="benefit-item">
            <div class="benefit-icon"><i class="ph ph-chart-line-up"></i></div>
            <div class="benefit-text">Existing apps can use the QA service too. We can add agent-based smoke tests, regression checks, and release validation without rebuilding your product.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

